    "description": "An M5 mixed-version boundary inspector carries a Stable (or LTS) support claim only when its current verdict is inside-window (the gate allows the mutating or privileged action), its peer is inside the supported skew window, its proof packet is current within its freshness SLO, the owner has signed off, and its backing claim publication holds. A boundary whose inspector reports any fail-closed verdict \u2014 unsupported skew, reconnect required, reinstall required, migration needed, or retest pending \u2014 or whose evidence is stale or missing must narrow below the cutline rather than mutate optimistically or inherit an adjacent in-window boundary."
  },
